          answer: 'Tourism accommodation includes various types: Hotels are classified from 1-star to 5-star based on facilities and services. Motels serve motorists with parking and repair facilities. Resorts provide recreational facilities like pools, golf courses, and sports. Residential Hotels operate on European plan without meals. Youth Hostels provide dormitory-style budget accommodation. Floating Hotels are on water. Capsule Hotels are compact sleeping units. Airport Hotels cater to transit passengers.', page: 100,
